      "body": "<strong>More balanced-looking:</strong> lots of overlap and back-and-forth. Both sides traded through the same prices.<br><br><strong>More imbalanced-looking:</strong> big one-direction candles with little overlap.<br><br>Some people call these “efficient” and “inefficient.” Neither one is <em>good</em> or <em>bad</em>. They’re descriptions of delivery.",
